<mxCell id="legend" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Double rectangle = Weak entity (ORDER_LINE, SHIPMENT; SHIPMENT key = order_numb + model_numb + shipping_date)&lt;br&gt;Dashed underline = Partial key (discriminator)&lt;br&gt;Solid underline = Primary key&lt;br&gt;Note: order_total and line_total are stored columns (denormalized), maintained by T4&lt;br&gt;Double line = Total participation / identifying relationship&lt;br&gt;1 / N = Cardinality (FK is shown by the relationship)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;strokeColor=#999999;fillColor=#f5f5f5;spacingLeft=8;"><mxGeometry x="2250" y="700" width="560" height="170" as="geometry" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>